    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18262" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφήγ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, 
